  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-12-security\"></a>\n\n### Security\n\n- `pipx run` now treats requirements with a version, extras, a marker or a direct URL as packages, and script URLs as downloads, even when the working directory contains a matching file ([#2408](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2408)) by @gaborbernat.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.12/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.11...1.18.12)\n",
